{"id":"5a24147c3ffbf113","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-partial-type-rank-drop.md","title":"Morley Rank Drop for Unary Partial Types","display":"df-partial-type-rank-drop — Morley Rank Drop for Unary Partial Types","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-partial-type-rank-drop","aliases":["17-df-partial-type-rank-drop"],"display":"df-partial-type-rank-drop — Morley Rank Drop for Unary Partial Types","depends_on":["[[17-df-unary-morley-rank]]","[[17-df-total-transcendence]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-symbols]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-7.2.3b","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-partial-type-rank-drop"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-partial-type-rank-drop</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-type-rank-drop — Morley Rank Drop for Unary Partial Types"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" href=\"?note=c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" title=\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a2084db1d8bf7af0\" href=\"?note=a2084db1d8bf7af0\" title=\"17-df-total-transcendence\">17-df-total-transcendence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.2.3b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{TotallyTranscendental}_L(T)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a2084db1d8bf7af0\" href=\"?note=a2084db1d8bf7af0\" title=\"17-df-total-transcendence\">17-df-total-transcendence</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\\models T\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\models T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathfrak C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathfrak C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_C,T_C,\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(F_C,T_C,\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" href=\"?note=c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" title=\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\subseteq F_C\">\\(p,q\\subseteq F_C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists r\\in S_1(T_C)\\;(p\\subseteq r)\">\\(\\exists r\\in S_1(T_C)\\;(p\\subseteq r)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists s\\in S_1(T_C)\\;(q\\subseteq s)\">\\(\\exists s\\in S_1(T_C)\\;(q\\subseteq s)\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{And}_{L(\\mathfrak C)}\">\\(\\operatorname{And}_{L(\\mathfrak C)}\\)</span> 包括空序列的情形，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3eb5325f08c84582\" href=\"?note=3eb5325f08c84582\" title=\"17-df-symbols\">17-df-symbols</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinConj}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{FinConj}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RankDrop}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{RankDrop}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FinConj}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{And}_{L(\\mathfrak C)}(s):s\\in p^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n&amp;:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FinConj}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\;\n\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neq\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\exists!\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;&amp;\\bigl(\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)=\\alpha\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RankDrop}_{\\mathfrak C}(q,p)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow p\\subseteq q\\land\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}(q)&lt;\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FinConj}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{And}_{L(\\mathfrak C)}(s):s\\in p^{&lt;\\omega}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n&amp;:=\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FinConj}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\;\n\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)\\},\\\\\n\\varnothing&amp;\\neq\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord},\\\\\n\\exists!\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;&amp;\\bigl(\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)=\\alpha\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\operatorname{RankSet}_{\\mathfrak C}(p)\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\beta),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RankDrop}_{\\mathfrak C}(q,p)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow p\\subseteq q\\land\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}(q)&lt;\\operatorname{TypeRank}_{\\mathfrak C}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 不预设对有限合取封闭；因此不能只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的单个成员取最小秩。新定义同时包含空合取，避免空部分型没有候选秩。完全型对有限合取封闭，故在完全型输入上仍与成员最小秩的形式相容。全超越性及一致性保证这里的候选秩集合非空；序数良序性保证最小值唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"li